\f1\b0 \cf2 One capability I think we should add later in M73 is an explicit 
\f4\b "Adopt Existing Position"
\f1\b0  workflow.\
Instead of treating broker-discovered positions as permanently advisory, the platform could let you intentionally adopt them.\
For example:
\f2 \
